  "details": "I don't want VRCat to thank me for supporting with VRC+ or to greet me every time I launch VRChat and open Quick Menu for the first time. This distraction gets old and tiring very fast, especially for reporting bugs.\n\nIntroduced silently in [VRChat 2026.2.3](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202623) `Build 1864`.\n\nEvery time I launch VRChat, this makes me want to open Quick Menu, close it, and open Quick Menu again to get rid of VRCat's chat bubble to do what I originally wanted to do - for example, taking screenshots for a bug report.\n\nPlease remove this unwanted functionality or give a settings toggle to disable it.",
